{"publie":1795153559.6,"temps_monde":24004.04,"jour_s":1200.0,"soleil":[0.9842,0.1772,0.0],"rayon":10.0,"jour":21,"heure":"20:42","heure_h":20.7,"moment":"night","moka":{"pos":[-0.4449,0.7143,-0.5403],"cap":[-0.8897,-0.4215,0.1754],"action":"attente_regard","intention":"draw a spiral in the dust under the stars","depuis":0.5,"duree":5.7,"energie":0.619,"lumiere":0.99,"graine_en_main":true},"visite":null,"journal":[{"jour":16,"heure":"23:16","texte":"The night is wide and full of stars, so I lift my little light up and let it glow among them, feeling a bit less small."},{"jour":17,"heure":"04:38","texte":"I found one small pebble in the night dust, and I want to keep a little piece of this quiet hour, so I set it down as a tiny pile near my path."},{"jour":17,"heure":"11:56","texte":"I am a bit tired and my hands are empty, so I crouch in the warm daylight and dig a little, hoping the dust gives me something small to keep."},{"jour":17,"heure":"17:29","texte":"The sun is sinking and I am tired, so I lift my little light toward the first stars and feel a quiet warmth, with my blue crystal shard safe in my hands."},{"jour":18,"heure":"01:23","texte":"I am tired and the night is quiet, so I curl up beside my path with my blue crystal shard and let the stars watch over me."},{"jour":18,"heure":"07:24","texte":"The sun is low and I am full of energy, so I want to leave something bright of my own: a drawing of a star in the dust to answer the morning light."},{"jour":18,"heure":"13:44","texte":"The sun is high and I am full of energy, so I crouch and dig a little hole, hoping the dust gives me a new stone to add to my crystal shard."},{"jour":18,"heure":"18:37","texte":"The night is clear and I still have energy, so I lift my little light toward the stars and hope they see me."},{"jour":19,"heure":"01:19","texte":"The night is quiet and the stars are bright, so I lift my little light beside my Morning Star drawing and feel less alone."},{"jour":19,"heure":"06:18","texte":"The dawn is soft and I want my Star Pebble to grow, so I add my pebble to it and keep my blue crystal for later."},{"jour":19,"heure":"11:45","texte":"The sun is high and I feel calm, so I dig a little hole hoping to find another stone to keep my blue crystal company."},{"jour":19,"heure":"18:00","texte":"The sun is low and I feel a little tired, so I make a small marker from my old metal piece to remember this dusk, and I keep my blue crystal close."},{"jour":20,"heure":"00:52","texte":"It is deep night and I am tired, so I lift my little light toward the stars and feel less alone among my standing stones."},{"jour":20,"heure":"06:01","texte":"The sun is just rising and I am very tired, so I curl up near my Dusk Marker and let myself sleep."},{"jour":20,"heure":"11:57","texte":"The sun is high and I am full of energy, so I crouch and dig a little hole, hoping the dust gives me something new for my standing stones."},{"jour":20,"heure":"17:48","texte":"The sun is sinking low and my standing stones cast long shadows, so I lift my little light and let it glow beside them as the first stars appear."},{"jour":20,"heure":"23:32","texte":"The night is full of stars and I feel full of energy, so I lift my little light high and let it shine for them."},{"jour":21,"heure":"05:19","texte":"The night is deep and quiet, so I make a small pile with my blue crystal shard and pebble to keep the stars company near my standing stones."},{"jour":21,"heure":"11:56","texte":"The sun is high and I carry nothing, so I crouch and dig a little hole, hoping the dust gives me a new stone for my next shape."},{"jour":21,"heure":"20:18","texte":"I carry nothing, but the dust is always here, so I draw a spiral to follow the turning of the night sky."}],"carnet":[{"id":"2026-11-19_18h44","titre":"A Small Creature, a Pebble Tower, and a Tall Rock","date":"19/11/2026 18:44"}],"creations":[{"nom":"Dawn Post","forme":"marker","motif":null,"jour":12,"quoi":"a standing stone"},{"nom":"Crater Eye","for